{"ID":"20240513082948-jul2pxe","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082948-jul2pxe","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082948-jul2pxe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175501-fupzoij\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175501-fupzoij\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:519,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175501-fupzoij\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:608,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:669\u0026#125;","title":"339","type":"doc","updated":"20240515110313"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513175501-fupzoij","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 837px;","id":"20240513175501-fupzoij","updated":"20240515110313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"237-3 S, N"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"62歲，偏瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008-05-23"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃癌，胃已切除掉70%  此次僅是做例行性的回診。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 仍無法深睡，已經有改善 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 雙足稍冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 大便很好."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 睡眠時身體寒/熱,：溫的"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 胃口好轉，有饑餓感. 胃氣已回升"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 小便中黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃濕(因胃的容量減少百分之七十,故多餘胃氣反逆)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區仍比較黃，心臟區扁平還有黃點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心包濕熱重"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區仍比較黃，心臟區扁平還有黃點應是吃西藥所造成的毒素，治則同前方重在清肝及補脾土 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1) 四神湯 蔗糖一包 七付 煮來當甜食吃 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"強化脾土"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2) 柴胡三錢 黃芩三錢 玉金五錢 龍膽草三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"清肝的積毒 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮三錢 茯苓五錢 澤瀉五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡滲利 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川穹三錢 白芍五錢 茜草三錢 炙鱉甲三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"活化肝的瘀血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵陳三錢 梔子三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 清肝膽虛熱與化濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生薑三片 陳皮三錢 厚樸二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 開胃 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮成三碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3）HT-40烏梅丸, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"苦溫化腸胃之濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30粒 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一天兩次 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"af b/s"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1． 肝區仍比較黃，結構比較松，心臟區扁平還有黃點，西醫檢查說鉀含量過高， 事實上應該是吃西藥過多。而產生的毒素，變成中醫治療上的盲點。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2． 脈大若肌肉疼痛，並易疲勞則為勞證，但此病人除脈大尚有舌苔濕，我們先清肝及排濕，使用此方後，病人若仍疲倦，則改為桂枝芍藥知母湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人只要有睡得好，吃得好，拉得好，則表示一切都很好，最好不要再到醫院去做是否有癌細存在胞檢驗，以免再度打開潘朵拉的黑盒子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}]}]}